<title>POLAND: GPRD APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.01 MLN.</title>
<headline>GPRD APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.01 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.01 vs   0.53 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.01 vs   0.53 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.18 vs   0.43 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    8.47 vs   4.63</p>
