<p> Net loss		 4.92 vs   3.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   4.92 vs   3.52</p>
<p> Operating loss	 5.57 vs   3.67</p>
<p> Sales		   18.66 vs  10.20</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish road builder is Gdanskie</p>
<p>Przedsiobiorstwo Robat Drogowych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
